4","surface":"孫皓","start":124,"end":126,"person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p004:m0127","surface":"充","start":127,"end":128,"person_id":"it3_dmr_2ze","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p004:m0148","surface":"郭逸","start":148,"end":150,"person_id":"9rr_46u_7ff","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p004:m0153","surface":"宋典","start":153,"end":155,"person_id":"a65_l8e_u18","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p004:m0167","surface":"玘","start":167,"end":168,"person_id":"i1w_a4z_a3g","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p004:m0177","surface":"逸","start":177,"end":178,"person_id":"9rr_46u_7ff","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p004:m0183","surface":"璯","start":183,"end":184,"person_id":"3c0_dtb_znh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi","book_id":"b-jinshu-058","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-058-zhou-qi-ws1775463"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-zha:p001","text":"劄字宣季。性矜險好利，外方內荏，少以豪右自處，州郡辟命皆不就。察孝廉，除郎中、大司馬齊王冏參軍。出補句容令，遷呉國上軍將軍。辟東海王越參軍，不就。以討錢璯功，賜爵漳浦亭侯。元帝爲丞相，表劄爲甯遠將軍、曆陽內史，不之職，轉從事中郎。徐馥平，以劄爲奮武將軍、呉興內史，録前後功，改封東遷縣侯，進號征虜將軍、臨揚州江北軍事、東中郎將，鎮塗中，未之職，轉右將軍、都督石頭水陸軍事。劄腳疾，不堪拜，固讓經年，有司彈奏，不得已乃視職。加散騎常侍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":44,"last_line":44,"raw_start":3378,"raw_end":3605,"raw_character_offsets":[3380,3381,3382,3383,3384,3385,3386,3387,3388,3389,3390,3391,3392,3393,3394,3395,3396,3397,3398,3399,3400,3401,3402,3403,3404,3405,3406,3407,3408,3409,3410,3411,3412,3413,3414,3415,3416,3417,3418,3419,3420,3421,3422,3423,3424,3425,3426,3427,3428,3429,3430,3431,3432,3433,3434,3435,3436,3437,3438,3439,3440,3441,3442,3443,3444,3445,3446,3447,3448,3449,3450,3451,3452,3453,3454,3455,3456,3457,3458,3459,34